<BaseLayout title="Affiliate Disclosure: How The Field & Farm Earns" description="How The Field & Farm handles affiliate links.">
  <h1>Affiliate Disclosure</h1>
  <p>Last updated: August 21, 2026</p>
  <p>
    The Field &amp; Farm participates in affiliate programs. When you click an affiliate link on this site and make a purchase, we may earn a commission: at no additional cost to you.
  </p>
  <h2>Our policy</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Affiliate relationships never influence our recommendations or rankings.</li>
    <li>We recommend products and services we would recommend regardless of any commission.</li>
    <li>Articles that contain affiliate links are marked as <em>affiliate-ready</em> in their footer or introduction.</li>
    <li>We disclose affiliate relationships as required by the FTC.</li>
  </ul>
  <h2>How to identify affiliate links</h2>
  <p>
    Links in our comparison guides and tool lists may be affiliate links. Informational links (to government pages, regulations, and documentation) are never affiliate links.
  </p>
  <p>
    If you have questions about our affiliate relationships, contact us via the <a href="/about/">About</a> page.
  </p>
</BaseLayout>
